# Design Token Recipe (defaults)

Use these as the baseline when modernizing a legacy server-rendered UI. All
values are derived from public design systems (Linear, Vercel, shadcn/ui,
Tailwind) — adjust per project.

## Colors (OKLCH)

```css
:root,
[data-theme="dark"] {
  /* Surfaces */
  --bg-1:      oklch(0.16 0.01 270);   /* page bg */
  --bg-2:      oklch(0.19 0.01 270);   /* sidebar */
  --bg-3:      oklch(0.22 0.01 270);   /* card */
  --bg-4:      oklch(0.26 0.01 270);   /* hover / code block */

  /* Lines */
  --border:    oklch(0.30 0.01 270);
  --border-strong: oklch(0.40 0.01 270);

  /* Text */
  --text:      oklch(0.95 0.005 270);
  --text-mute: oklch(0.70 0.01  270);
  --text-dim:  oklch(0.50 0.01  270);

  /* Semantic */
  --green: oklch(0.72 0.16  150);
  --amber: oklch(0.78 0.15   75);
  --red:   oklch(0.68 0.20   25);
  --blue:  oklch(0.72 0.14  245);
  --cyan:  oklch(0.78 0.12  200);
  --purple:oklch(0.70 0.16  300);
}

[data-theme="light"] {
  --bg-1:      oklch(0.99 0.003 270);
  --bg-2:      oklch(0.96 0.005 270);
  --bg-3:      oklch(0.93 0.006 270);
  --bg-4:      oklch(0.88 0.008 270);

  --border:        oklch(0.85 0.006 270);
  --border-strong: oklch(0.75 0.008 270);

  --text:      oklch(0.18 0.01 270);
  --text-mute: oklch(0.45 0.01 270);
  --text-dim:  oklch(0.60 0.01 270);

  --green: oklch(0.55 0.18 150);
  --amber: oklch(0.65 0.18  75);
  --red:   oklch(0.55 0.22  25);
  --blue:  oklch(0.55 0.20 245);
  --cyan:  oklch(0.55 0.18 200);
  --purple:oklch(0.55 0.20 300);
}
```

## Type scale

```css
--font-sans: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
             'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
--font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace;

--fs-xs:   11.5px;
--fs-sm:   13px;
--fs-md:   14px;   /* base */
--fs-lg:   16px;
--fs-xl:   20px;
--fs-2xl:  26px;
--fs-3xl:  34px;

--lh-tight: 1.2;
--lh-base:  1.5;
--lh-loose: 1.7;
```

## Spacing (4px base)

```css
--space-1: 4px;
--space-2: 8px;
--space-3: 12px;
--space-4: 16px;
--space-5: 24px;
--space-6: 32px;
--space-7: 48px;
--space-8: 64px;
```

## Radius / shadow / motion

```css
--radius-sm:  4px;
--radius-md:  8px;
--radius-lg:  12px;
--radius-full: 9999px;

--shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px oklch(0 0 0 / 0.20);
--shadow-md: 0 4px 12px oklch(0 0 0 / 0.25), 0 1px 2px oklch(0 0 0 / 0.20);
--shadow-lg: 0 16px 40px oklch(0 0 0 / 0.30), 0 2px 6px oklch(0 0 0 / 0.20);

--ease-out:    cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
--ease-in-out: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
--dur-fast:  120ms;
--dur-base:  200ms;
--dur-slow:  320ms;

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  :root {
    --dur-fast: 0ms; --dur-base: 0ms; --dur-slow: 0ms;
  }
}
```

## Class taxonomy cheatsheet

| Group    | Classes                                                                            |
| -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Layout   | `.container`, `.sidebar`, `.main`, `.stack`, `.cluster`, `.grid`, `.grid-{cols}`   |
| Buttons  | `.btn`, `.btn-primary`, `.btn-ghost`, `.btn-danger`, `.btn-sm`, `.btn-icon`         |
| Badges   | `.badge-custom`, `.badge-{green,amber,red,blue,dim,cyan,purple}`, `.badge-{critical,high,medium,low,info}` |
| Alerts   | `.alert-custom`, `.alert-{red,green,amber,blue}`, `.alert-link`                    |
| Cards    | `.card`, `.card-header`, `.card-body`, `.card-footer`, `.stat-card`                 |
| Tables   | `.table-custom`, `.table-compact`, `.empty-state-cell`                              |
| Forms    | `.form-input`, `.form-select`, `.form-label`, `.form-help`, `.form-error`          |
| Utility  | `.font-mono`, `.text-{mute,dim,cyan}`, `.cell-truncate`, `.empty-state`, `.spin-slow` |
| States   | `.status-dot`, `.status-{running,completed,failed,pending}`                        |

## Bootstrap Icons quick reference

Replace emoji with `bi` icons. Common mappings:

| Emoji | bi icon                            |
| ----- | ---------------------------------- |
| 🔒    | `bi-shield-lock-fill`              |
| ⚠️    | `bi-exclamation-triangle-fill`     |
| 🔶    | `bi-exclamation-circle-fill`       |
| 🟡    | `bi-info-circle-fill`              |
| ℹ️    | `bi-info-circle`                   |
| ✓     | `bi-check-circle-fill`             |
| ✗     | `bi-x-circle-fill`                 |
| ⚙     | `bi-gear-fill`                     |
| 🔍    | `bi-search`                        |
| 📊    | `bi-bar-chart-fill`                |
| 🏆    | `bi-trophy-fill`                   |
| ☁     | `bi-cloud-fill`                    |
| 🚀    | `bi-rocket-takeoff-fill`           |
| ⚡    | `bi-lightning-fill`                |
| 🐛    | `bi-bug-fill`                      |
| 📁    | `bi-folder-fill`                   |
| 🔗    | `bi-link-45deg`                    |
| 💾    | `bi-download`                      |
| 🔄    | `bi-arrow-repeat`                  |

Load once in `base.html`:

```html
<link rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
```
